  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "你查清楚她是在哪儿被拍的  (Find Out Where She Was Photographed)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Minutes later, Kaiwen marches into Chun Yuqiao's office scolding him for losing his composure and scaring Bu Xiaogu, begging his boss to stop bottling everything up inside. Listen to Kaiwen and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我不是跟你说了吗？想要情路顺利，工作上别走太近！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你就算沉不住气，也不能这么着急给她转正啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你刚才把人家小谷吓着了，你知不知道？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你心里有什么憋屈的话，你说出来行不行？我求求你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你总自虐干吗呀？哪回你自虐，最后受苦的不是我们？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "莫不是因为小谷的事，有点后悔了是不是？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我说那些主意呢，你也别太当回事，别往心里去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷这丫头路子野，说不定不会影响你们感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你话那么多呢，能闭会儿嘴吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你知道什么叫闭嘴吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你查清楚辛惠美是在哪儿被拍的，还有找杰瑞把她日程给我。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我不是跟你说了吗？想要情路顺利，工作上别走太近！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't I tell you yesterday? If you want romance to go smoothly, keep some distance at work!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你就算沉不住气，也不能这么着急给她转正啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if you lost your cool, you shouldn't have rushed to promote her like that!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你刚才把人家小谷吓着了，你知不知道？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you realize you just frightened poor Xiaogu out of her wits?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你心里有什么憋屈的话，你说出来行不行？我求求你了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If something is eating at you inside, please just say it out loud — I'm begging you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你总自虐干吗呀？哪回你自虐，最后受苦的不是我们？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you always torture yourself? Every time you do, aren't we the ones who suffer too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "莫不是因为小谷的事，有点后悔了是不是？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — you're already regretting snapping at Xiaogu, aren't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我说那些主意呢，你也别太当回事，别往心里去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forget those silly ideas I gave you earlier; don't take them to heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷这丫头路子野，说不定不会影响你们感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu is a spirited girl — working together might not hurt your chances after all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你话那么多呢，能闭会儿嘴吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you talk so much — can you shut your mouth for a minute?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你知道什么叫闭嘴吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you even know what shutting up means?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你查清楚辛惠美是在哪儿被拍的，还有找杰瑞把她日程给我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Find out exactly where Xin Huimei was photographed, and get her schedule from her manager.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我不是跟你说了吗？想要情路顺利，工作上别走太近！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你就算沉不住气，也不能这么着急给她转正啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
